  "source_note": "Schedule C locked (#80). #78 survive 35 + 5 thin-act fills (P31 archive_cache, P32 grav_anchor, P34 buoyancy_tanks, P37 escape_thrusters, P39 finale_key). Intentional 1-gap at P16/P24/P29. #81 \u22642 empty satisfied. Endless gate remains finale+endless_unlock @40 (manual bind on endless). #162 (GD): research_lab P24->P15 as the combo-research building; side_drills, shields, grav_anchor, buoyancy_tanks, escape_thrusters are tech-tree nodes at their own planet (unlockVia tech_tree, treeLane per #160). #153 (GD amendment 2): remote_detonator added at P22 (Upgrade, planet_gate, planned) after shields; dynamite sizes 2\u201310 extend blasting_charges (labelled both, no rows); P22\u2013P40 cumulative +1 (P40 61). #309 (GD decision, Horizontal): bore_gun added at P1 (Upgrade, planet_gate, planned), the named exception that pushes no other P1 row; P1\u2013P40 cumulative +1 (P40 62). #650 (GD lock, star map): jump_drive added at P5 (Upgrade, planet_gate, shipped), the one new row of the star map; P5\u2013P40 cumulative +1 (P40 63). #823 (GD lock 24 Oct, planet kits P1\u2013P5): merchants moved P10->P1 (vision->planned) and five kit items added (cache_crate P1, scree_plough P2, damp_flask P3, shard_tongs P4, vent_vane P5; Merchant, planet_gate, planned); P1\u2013P9 cumulative +2..+6, P10\u2013P40 +5 (P40 68). source_hash recomputed by source_hash.mjs (method now committed; the #80 value 419ca56d\u2026 was not reproducible). #900 (HS/GD 25 Oct, P1\u2013P5 audit): statuses refreshed from the code on main (16 planned/building rows read shipped); blasting_charges re-pinned P7->P1 as a price-band anchor (dynamite money-only from P1) and blast_rock added at P7 (Environment, planet_gate, planned); P1\u2013P40 cumulative +1 (P40 69).",
